WEBVTT

01:40.000 --> 01:41.520
The will-o'-the-wisp was man-made.

01:42.040 --> 01:44.920
Those who were burned to death
must have acted by order of someone.

01:46.160 --> 01:47.880
Otherwise, they wouldn't say those things.

01:47.960 --> 01:50.920
Investigate the whereabouts
of the deceased before they died.

01:51.000 --> 01:52.400
Find common ground.

01:52.480 --> 01:53.320
Yes.

01:53.800 --> 01:55.680
The will-o'-the-wisp is just a trigger.

01:56.640 --> 01:59.320
The real show is yet to come.

02:02.000 --> 02:03.200
Any news from the Jiang family?

02:03.280 --> 02:05.240
Tomorrow is the family's
ancestor worship day.

02:05.320 --> 02:06.480
There's not much besides that.

02:06.560 --> 02:09.520
Are you worried
this will drag Ms. Jiang Li down?

02:10.600 --> 02:12.000
I can go and keep an eye on her.

02:12.080 --> 02:12.920
Come back here.

02:14.280 --> 02:15.480
Did I tell you to go?

02:15.560 --> 02:17.120
Focus on the actual business.

02:22.000 --> 02:24.080
Why is his lordship so moody?

02:24.160 --> 02:25.640
One moment,
he asked me to deliver a message,

02:25.720 --> 02:27.240
then stopped me
from watching her the next.

02:27.320 --> 02:28.840
The last time you delivered a message,

02:28.920 --> 02:30.400
Ms. Jiang Li didn't come to thank him.

02:31.360 --> 02:32.800
Of course his lordship is displeased.

02:34.600 --> 02:35.840
That's not right.

02:35.920 --> 02:37.840
Why do you seem
to understand everything suddenly?

02:38.360 --> 02:39.720
I've always been like this.

02:40.840 --> 02:41.680
As for you,

02:42.320 --> 02:44.840
maybe you've turned into a fool
after being caned too many times.

02:50.600 --> 02:55.560
GREAT VIRTUE CASTS A LONG SHADOW

02:55.640 --> 02:59.800
Ancestors of the Jiang family,
please bless our family continuously

03:00.360 --> 03:04.720
throughout the year.

03:37.520 --> 03:38.360
Li'er.

03:42.320 --> 03:43.200
Jiang Li.

03:43.880 --> 03:45.480
Where are her manners?

03:46.600 --> 03:48.920
Yuanbai, this is against the rules.

03:57.040 --> 03:59.840
YE ZHENZHEN'S MEMORIAL TABLET

03:59.920 --> 04:00.800
Madam Ye,

04:01.760 --> 04:03.760
you must be reunited with Jiang Li now.

04:05.680 --> 04:06.720
Don't worry.

04:07.960 --> 04:09.240
I'm indebted to her,

04:10.160 --> 04:11.760
so I will help her get justice.

04:13.160 --> 04:14.000
Li'er,

04:14.080 --> 04:16.040
female family members
can't join the worship.

04:16.120 --> 04:19.360
You're breaking the rules. Get down here.

04:19.440 --> 04:20.560
That's right.

04:20.640 --> 04:21.560
Dear,

04:21.640 --> 04:24.600
it's my fault for not telling her clearly.

04:25.640 --> 04:26.680
Father,

04:28.320 --> 04:29.800
I haven't seen Mother for a long time.

04:31.080 --> 04:33.240
Please forgive me for being rude.

04:33.320 --> 04:34.160
Li'er,

04:34.640 --> 04:36.440
didn't you hear the elders?

04:37.240 --> 04:39.920
It's one thing to act out at home.

04:40.000 --> 04:44.080
But now, you are in front
of the whole family and ancestors,

04:44.160 --> 04:45.560
so behave yourself.

04:45.640 --> 04:47.320
I just want to kowtow to my mother.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.320
Please allow it, Mother.

04:51.360 --> 04:52.280
It seems like

04:52.360 --> 04:54.440
you are determined
to break the rules today.

04:54.520 --> 04:55.960
I just want to pay my respects.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.040
Jiang Li.

05:02.240 --> 05:03.160
Never mind.

05:04.080 --> 05:06.200
Let her do it this once.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.960
These are rules set by our ancestors.

05:09.440 --> 05:11.280
Breaking them

05:11.360 --> 05:13.520
will bring trouble to the family!

05:13.600 --> 05:14.640
Dear,

05:14.720 --> 05:16.360
someone has to teach her the rules.

05:16.440 --> 05:17.880
If no one wants to be the bad guy,

05:18.360 --> 05:19.200
I will do it.

05:21.800 --> 05:22.640
Dear.

05:25.280 --> 05:26.840
Jiang Li, get up.

05:27.800 --> 05:28.720
Get up.

05:30.480 --> 05:31.520
Get up.

05:31.600 --> 05:33.000
This is inappropriate.

05:33.080 --> 05:34.200
Get up.

05:35.440 --> 05:36.520
Get up.

05:36.600 --> 05:37.840
Stop bowing.

05:37.920 --> 05:38.840
Let me go.

05:38.920 --> 05:40.000
Get up.

05:40.080 --> 05:41.840
Don't disturb my Yue'er!

05:41.920 --> 05:43.360
Don't bother my Yue'er!

05:43.440 --> 05:44.680
Don't disturb my Yue'er!

05:45.240 --> 05:47.480
Get lost!

05:52.520 --> 05:53.360
Hey.

05:56.920 --> 05:57.800
How did she get out?

05:58.280 --> 05:59.400
Guards!

05:59.480 --> 06:00.360
Take her back!

06:01.440 --> 06:02.840
- My Yue'er.
- Quickly!

06:03.320 --> 06:05.720
- My dear Yue…
- Send her back!

06:07.480 --> 06:08.320
My dear Yue'er.

06:08.400 --> 06:09.480
Yue'er. My dear Yue'er.

06:09.560 --> 06:10.720
- Come!
- Move it.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.000
My dear Yue'er.

06:12.080 --> 06:12.920
My dear Yue'er.

06:14.840 --> 06:17.040
Yue'er. My Yue'er.

06:19.400 --> 06:20.240
Yue'er.

06:20.320 --> 06:21.160
CONCUBINE HU

06:24.640 --> 06:26.760
Dear, are you all right?

06:28.920 --> 06:29.760
Let's go.

06:37.920 --> 06:38.760
Let's go home.

06:40.680 --> 06:41.640
Look at what happened.

06:49.920 --> 06:52.400
Jiang Li, you are so brave.

06:53.480 --> 06:54.480
Actually, I also think

06:55.080 --> 06:57.240
it's unfair
that female family members can't worship.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.360
Who was that woman?

06:59.920 --> 07:01.240
That's Concubine Hu.

07:01.320 --> 07:02.200
Don't you remember?

07:02.280 --> 07:03.120
When you were little,

07:03.200 --> 07:05.400
you were very close to Jiang Yue,

07:05.480 --> 07:06.560
her daughter.

07:07.720 --> 07:08.600
Old Madam,

07:09.320 --> 07:10.920
please spare this baby.

07:11.800 --> 07:14.680
- Please. Spare this baby.
- Concubine Hu used to be an intimate maid.

07:14.760 --> 07:17.040
But she got pregnant before your mother,
the legitimate wife,

07:17.120 --> 07:18.240
which contradicted social norms.

07:18.840 --> 07:20.960
Grandmother originally
didn't allow her to keep the baby.

07:21.040 --> 07:22.080
After all, if she begets a son,

07:22.160 --> 07:25.280
the eldest son of the Jiang family
would be borne by a maid,

07:25.360 --> 07:26.520
which would be a disgrace.

07:27.400 --> 07:28.720
But your mother was kindhearted,

07:28.800 --> 07:30.960
so she saved both Concubine Hu
and her unborn child.

07:31.480 --> 07:33.320
For the sake of the child,

07:34.080 --> 07:35.000
please spare her.

07:40.560 --> 07:42.560
Concubine Hu was grateful
for your mother's kindness,

07:42.640 --> 07:45.320
so she never competed or caused trouble
and was kind to everyone.

07:45.400 --> 07:48.720
Less than two years later,
your mother had you.

07:48.800 --> 07:51.240
The harmony among the Jiang family's
wife and concubines

07:51.320 --> 07:53.640
became a good story
among upper-class households.

07:55.560 --> 07:56.560
What happened after that?

07:57.840 --> 07:59.280
Everything changed

07:59.760 --> 08:01.920
after your mother's death.

08:23.800 --> 08:26.200
Jiang Yue accidentally drowned
while playing in the rockery.

08:26.280 --> 08:27.440
It took hours

08:27.520 --> 08:29.720
before a passing maid
got her body out of the water.

08:31.640 --> 08:33.640
- Someone died!
- Help!

08:33.720 --> 08:34.559
Yue'er, get up.

08:35.280 --> 08:37.159
Wake up. Open your eyes and look at me.

08:37.760 --> 08:39.720
Look at me. I'll take you home, all right?

08:40.799 --> 08:43.760
I'll take you home. Yue'er!

08:45.920 --> 08:46.840
Yue'er!

08:46.920 --> 08:49.480
From then on, Concubine Hu was heartbroken

08:49.560 --> 08:50.720
and eventually had hysteria.

08:51.280 --> 08:53.440
She wandered around the house
looking disheveled.

08:54.240 --> 08:55.560
There was no other choice

08:55.640 --> 08:57.640
but to lock her in the woodshed
in the backyard.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.640
Yue'er!

08:59.720 --> 09:02.160
But if she's locked in the woodshed,

09:02.640 --> 09:03.880
how did she end up here?

09:04.440 --> 09:05.440
That is the strange part.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.960
On the day you were sent to Zhennv Hall,

09:08.040 --> 09:10.200
Concubine Hu disappeared
from the woodshed too.

09:10.280 --> 09:11.960
Ji Shuran searched for her for a long time

09:12.040 --> 09:13.400
- but couldn't find her.
- No.

09:13.480 --> 09:15.360
- Concubine Hu!
- Concubine Hu!

09:15.440 --> 09:17.280
Later on, guess where she went.

09:20.640 --> 09:22.920
She's a madwoman with no carriage.

09:23.400 --> 09:25.440
No one knows how she got here.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.920
But according to Grandmother,

09:28.000 --> 09:31.800
she keeps mumbling things like
not dragging the Jiang family down.

09:31.880 --> 09:32.720
Grandmother thought

09:32.800 --> 09:35.320
it was risky to keep her at home too.

09:35.400 --> 09:37.040
So she ordered someone

09:37.120 --> 09:38.560
to tidy up this room and let her stay

09:38.640 --> 09:39.560
as the grave keeper.

09:39.640 --> 09:42.360
It seems like Concubine Hu
is also a pitiful soul.

09:43.120 --> 09:45.200
Since she was so close to my mother,

09:45.280 --> 09:48.080
I should visit her often in the future.

09:48.160 --> 09:49.320
You can't.

09:49.400 --> 09:51.480
She's mad and can be violent.

09:51.560 --> 09:52.800
Moreover, if you keep coming,

09:52.880 --> 09:54.280
what if others see it?

09:54.360 --> 09:55.320
They'll start gossiping.

09:55.400 --> 09:57.760
It's fine. There will be opportunities
to visit her in the future.

09:59.760 --> 10:00.840
All right.

10:03.680 --> 10:04.520
Tong'er,

10:05.640 --> 10:08.240
do you find Concubine Hu a little strange?

10:08.760 --> 10:10.600
Strange? How so?

10:10.680 --> 10:13.320
Earlier, she seemed
to be observing me secretly.

10:13.400 --> 10:15.520
Especially after I confronted Ji Shuran,

10:15.600 --> 10:17.680
her gaze was fixed on me.

10:17.760 --> 10:19.080
Anyway, it was just strange.

10:19.160 --> 10:21.440
Are you suspecting
that she doesn't really have hysteria?

10:22.000 --> 10:25.280
But why would a normal person
pretend to be crazy

10:25.360 --> 10:26.760
and guard dead people's tombs?

10:29.160 --> 10:30.760
JIANG FAMILY ANCESTRAL SHRINE

10:31.680 --> 10:32.520
Let's go.

11:04.280 --> 11:05.280
Are you all right?

11:06.240 --> 11:07.080
I'm fine.

11:11.760 --> 11:12.640
What happened?

11:13.560 --> 11:15.560
Ms. Jiang Li, I'm really sorry.

11:15.640 --> 11:17.000
The reins unexpectedly broke.

11:17.080 --> 11:18.480
The horse also ran off.

11:18.560 --> 11:20.800
Why did the reins
suddenly break for no reason?

11:20.880 --> 11:23.440
Maybe it's worn out.
I'll find the horse right away.

11:23.520 --> 11:24.360
Hurry.

11:35.120 --> 11:36.000
What happened to you?

11:36.080 --> 11:38.360
Ruoyao, my horse ran away.

11:39.280 --> 11:40.320
What bad luck.

11:40.920 --> 11:43.560
Jinhua, stay with her maid here.

11:43.640 --> 11:45.080
Ride in my carriage and leave first.

11:45.160 --> 11:46.240
Yes.

11:48.040 --> 11:48.880
What's the matter?

11:48.960 --> 11:50.360
Are you planning to go back later

11:50.440 --> 11:53.040
and play the victim in front of Father
and Grandmother?

11:53.600 --> 11:55.360
You're always good at spinning tales.

11:55.440 --> 11:57.720
I don't want to go back
and let you accuse my mother

11:57.800 --> 12:00.040
of damaging your carriage
and plotting against you again.

12:07.280 --> 12:09.840
In that case, thank you for the ride.

12:18.120 --> 12:19.200
You should know

12:19.280 --> 12:21.240
about my upcoming marriage
to the Qi family.

12:21.320 --> 12:22.520
I heard about it.

12:22.600 --> 12:24.680
You ruined my engagement
with Zhou Yanbang.

12:25.240 --> 12:27.200
You must be happy now.

12:27.280 --> 12:28.960
He is not a good man for you anyway.

12:29.040 --> 12:30.040
You know nothing.

12:30.120 --> 12:31.400
At this point,

12:32.120 --> 12:33.840
do you feel any remorse towards me?

12:36.320 --> 12:37.760
If I'm not mistaken,

12:38.440 --> 12:41.960
it was you and Ji Shuran
who tried to set me up first.

12:42.040 --> 12:43.600
That's because you've been targeting us

12:43.680 --> 12:45.080
since you returned.

12:45.160 --> 12:46.240
If you

12:46.320 --> 12:47.800
stayed at Zhennv Hall,

12:48.520 --> 12:50.280
none of this would have happened to me.

12:50.360 --> 12:52.200
I'd still be the only legitimate daughter.

12:52.280 --> 12:55.320
It's all your fault.
It's all because of you!

12:55.880 --> 12:57.680
You said I've taken everything from you.

12:59.280 --> 13:00.360
But have you ever thought

13:01.040 --> 13:02.520
about who you took

13:02.600 --> 13:04.360
all the things you have from?

13:04.440 --> 13:05.480
Do you know

13:05.560 --> 13:07.520
what kind of life I had at Zhennv Hall?

13:09.680 --> 13:12.280
Why do I have to care
about how your life was at Zhennv Hall?

13:13.120 --> 13:13.960
Give me your hand.

13:18.160 --> 13:19.160
Does it hurt?

13:19.240 --> 13:20.600
I'm asking you if it hurts.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.360
The pain I endured at Zhennv Hall

13:24.440 --> 13:26.560
was thousands of times worse than this.

13:27.360 --> 13:28.400
When I was eight,

13:28.480 --> 13:30.760
did I really cause harm to your mother?

13:32.400 --> 13:33.400
They framed me

13:33.480 --> 13:35.040
and sent me to Zhennv Hall unjustly.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.000
What's the matter?

13:37.480 --> 13:39.400
Can't I return to clear my name?

13:41.280 --> 13:43.680
I have no prejudice

13:43.760 --> 13:44.800
or old grudges against you.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.760
We were both young back then.

13:48.800 --> 13:50.920
I believe it wasn't your idea

13:51.000 --> 13:53.000
for me to stay at Zhennv Hall for so long.

13:53.080 --> 13:54.160
Now that I'm back,

13:54.760 --> 13:56.200
I just want to reclaim

13:56.280 --> 13:58.000
what rightfully belongs to Jiang Li.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.040
Nothing more.

13:59.760 --> 14:01.160
If you insist on thinking

14:01.240 --> 14:03.080
that I took everything from you

14:03.160 --> 14:04.440
and keep pressuring me,

14:05.640 --> 14:06.800
I can only tell you one thing.

14:07.480 --> 14:08.320
You're a fool.

14:08.400 --> 14:10.160
What did you say? Say it again!

14:10.240 --> 14:11.640
- Of course I can say it again.
- I…

14:11.720 --> 14:12.600
Jiang Ruoyao,

14:12.680 --> 14:14.680
have you gone mad
from staying at a mansion?

14:15.280 --> 14:17.200
As the legitimate daughter
of the Jiang family,

14:17.280 --> 14:18.680
you've shattered our sisterly bond

14:18.760 --> 14:20.560
for such a worthless man
from the Zhou family.

14:20.640 --> 14:22.160
Think carefully about it.

14:23.040 --> 14:23.960
Do you not regret it?

14:24.760 --> 14:25.920
Calling you foolish now

14:26.000 --> 14:27.560
is being lenient to you.

14:27.640 --> 14:30.440
Just because you're taking
the moral high ground doesn't mean

14:30.520 --> 14:31.440
I will buy your story.

14:31.520 --> 14:32.600
No matter what,

14:32.680 --> 14:33.880
you owe me.

14:34.760 --> 14:37.320
You must pay for what you've done to me.

14:37.920 --> 14:38.960
What's the price?

14:49.640 --> 14:52.520
Don't move. Behave and come with me.

16:00.280 --> 16:01.440
Why did you knock her out?

16:02.000 --> 16:04.280
Didn't you say we're only after money?

16:04.360 --> 16:06.760
We could just ask her
where the money is and leave.

16:06.840 --> 16:09.680
- By delaying like this, if we get caught--
- She's the obstacle between us.

16:10.360 --> 16:12.320
Without her,
we could have been together long ago.

16:12.920 --> 16:13.840
Think about it.

16:13.920 --> 16:15.040
Before Jiang Li came back,

16:15.120 --> 16:17.840
you were the prettiest
and best guqin player in the capital.

16:17.920 --> 16:20.320
I was also a handsome
and talented young man.

16:21.440 --> 16:22.880
But we've become like this now.

16:23.520 --> 16:25.200
Shouldn't Jiang Li die?

16:25.280 --> 16:26.480
Shouldn't she?

16:26.560 --> 16:28.120
Are you planning to kill her?

16:28.200 --> 16:29.360
In the deep mountains and forests,

16:29.440 --> 16:31.920
who would know we are behind this?

16:32.800 --> 16:35.680
Even if we were caught, no one
would wash their dirty linen in public.

16:36.280 --> 16:38.520
The Jiang and Zhou families
will protect us at all costs.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.640
Are you crazy?

16:40.160 --> 16:41.040
This is a human life!

16:41.120 --> 16:42.400
She's a troublemaker.

16:42.480 --> 16:43.920
We won't have peace until she's gone!

16:44.760 --> 16:45.680
Ruoyao,

16:45.760 --> 16:46.720
I'm doing this

16:46.800 --> 16:48.600
so we can be together.

16:48.680 --> 16:49.560
Last night,

16:50.760 --> 16:51.680
have you forgotten

16:53.120 --> 16:54.160
what you said?

16:54.960 --> 16:55.800
Ruoyao,

16:57.280 --> 16:58.800
I finally got to see you.

17:00.240 --> 17:03.000
Aren't you already married to Yu'e?

17:03.080 --> 17:05.440
Why are you saying these things now?

17:05.520 --> 17:08.440
Ruoyao, you know this clearly.

17:08.520 --> 17:09.800
I was set up.

17:10.520 --> 17:12.800
Besides, I've never stopped
writing to you all this time.

17:13.800 --> 17:15.240
I've never touched Jiang Yu'e.

17:15.319 --> 17:16.599
You're the only one I love.

17:16.680 --> 17:18.359
What's the use of saying all this now?

17:18.440 --> 17:19.400
Do you know…

17:22.000 --> 17:22.880
Do you know

17:23.359 --> 17:25.800
that my mother wants to marry me
into the Qi family?

17:26.800 --> 17:27.839
How about…

17:29.840 --> 17:30.760
we elope?

17:33.880 --> 17:34.720
What?

17:36.800 --> 17:38.280
Let's elope to a place far away.

17:39.680 --> 17:42.000
To a place surrounded
by green hills and clear waters.

17:42.520 --> 17:43.520
We'll gather some money

17:44.280 --> 17:45.720
and live a simple life there.

17:45.800 --> 17:46.720
Away from the capital

17:46.800 --> 17:48.880
and away from everyone
and everything you dislike.

17:48.960 --> 17:49.840
Just us.

17:51.520 --> 17:54.760
But my mother
is keeping a close eye on me now.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.800
I'm afraid it will be hard

17:56.880 --> 17:58.760
to quickly get money from home.

17:59.360 --> 18:00.720
I can't bear to see you suffer.

18:01.320 --> 18:02.520
I'll gather the money myself.

18:03.040 --> 18:05.800
If necessary, I can work as a laborer.

18:05.880 --> 18:08.120
In any case, I won't let you suffer.

18:08.200 --> 18:10.640
You're from a prestigious clan,
a scholarly family.

18:10.720 --> 18:11.800
- How can you--
- So what?

18:12.560 --> 18:13.880
I just want to be with you.

18:16.480 --> 18:17.320
Ruoyao,

18:18.040 --> 18:19.280
I suddenly remembered someone.

18:20.680 --> 18:22.040
She should provide the money.

18:25.440 --> 18:26.280
Who?

18:26.360 --> 18:27.680
Jiang Li.

18:27.760 --> 18:29.680
She has the backing
of the wealthy Ye family.

18:29.760 --> 18:31.200
If we kidnap her,

18:31.280 --> 18:32.680
we can get a lot of money.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.680
It'll be enough for our future.

18:38.040 --> 18:41.040
You've wanted to kill her from the start.

18:42.040 --> 18:43.080
Am I right?

18:43.160 --> 18:44.520
You've been lying to me all along.

18:44.600 --> 18:46.920
Ruoyao, trust me.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.560
I won't harm you.

18:48.640 --> 18:50.200
Ruoyao, believe me.

18:50.280 --> 18:51.360
Ruoyao.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.280
Ruoyao, you can't go.

18:52.360 --> 18:53.600
If you go, it'll be over for us!

18:53.680 --> 18:55.640
- Let me go.
- Ruoyao, listen to me!

18:55.720 --> 18:56.560
Ruoyao!

19:07.200 --> 19:09.040
Why are all of you forcing me?

19:10.120 --> 19:11.080
Jiang Li

19:13.000 --> 19:15.120
must pay the price.

19:29.280 --> 19:31.200
I invited you
on the day of the palace banquet.

19:32.560 --> 19:33.760
It's fine if you didn't come.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.720
Why did you have to set me up?

19:36.800 --> 19:38.760
I never intended to set you up.

19:40.520 --> 19:42.680
That day, just like you,

19:43.520 --> 19:45.120
I was also a prey who fell into a trap.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.560
Stop arguing.

19:48.640 --> 19:51.040
Jiang Yu'e has told me everything.
You were behind all of this!

19:51.520 --> 19:52.880
I don't know what you're saying.

19:53.520 --> 19:55.440
You betrayed me.

19:55.520 --> 19:59.840
It was you who made me end up like this.

20:00.560 --> 20:01.480
You can't escape me.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.840
Jiang Li,

20:09.520 --> 20:11.760
you think you're a person of value, right?

20:14.040 --> 20:14.880
All right.

20:16.440 --> 20:19.000
Why don't we make up for what we failed

20:19.080 --> 20:20.240
to do that night?

20:24.800 --> 20:25.640
Zhou Yanbang!

20:26.680 --> 20:29.080
You're the son of the Marquis of Ningyuan.

20:29.560 --> 20:31.360
How can your mind be so muddled and dirty?

20:31.440 --> 20:33.840
Can't you even figure out
who really framed you?

20:34.880 --> 20:36.080
Who do you think you are?

20:36.160 --> 20:37.640
Who are you to lecture me?

20:37.720 --> 20:40.800
If anything happens to me today,

20:42.520 --> 20:44.040
do you think you can get away with it?

20:44.120 --> 20:46.040
Even if the Zhou
and Jiang families don't pursue it,

20:46.120 --> 20:47.680
the Ye family will have my back.

20:47.760 --> 20:50.040
If you, a patrimonial nobleman,
end up in jail,

20:50.560 --> 20:51.920
you'll ruin your reputation

20:52.000 --> 20:53.720
and disgrace the Zhou family!

21:00.120 --> 21:01.520
Jiang Li.

21:02.320 --> 21:03.840
I almost fell for your deception again.

21:05.120 --> 21:06.800
But you've reminded me of something.

21:07.600 --> 21:09.320
After I'm done with you,

21:10.760 --> 21:14.440
I'll cut the tendons
in your feet and hands,

21:14.520 --> 21:16.800
then cut off your tongue.

21:16.880 --> 21:20.720
Finally, I'll gouge out your eyes.

21:21.280 --> 21:23.640
Then you won't be able to speak, write,

21:23.720 --> 21:25.240
or see.

21:25.320 --> 21:27.280
How will you accuse me then?

21:49.040 --> 21:49.960
Wait.

21:50.760 --> 21:51.600
Zhou Yanbang,

21:52.600 --> 21:54.400
are you not afraid
of breaking Ruoyao's heart

21:54.480 --> 21:56.080
by doing this in front of her?

21:56.560 --> 21:59.840
Every daughter of the Jiang family
fights for their own desires,

22:00.480 --> 22:01.960
except for Ruoyao.

22:02.040 --> 22:03.120
She desires nothing else.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.080
You're the only one she wants.

22:05.160 --> 22:06.520
No matter what I do,

22:07.040 --> 22:08.760
she'll forgive me

22:08.840 --> 22:10.640
as long as I coax her.

22:11.480 --> 22:14.200
Her mother strictly
controlled her since childhood.

22:14.280 --> 22:15.440
She lacks drive.

22:15.520 --> 22:17.000
She'll devotedly follow me

22:18.520 --> 22:20.960
if I just coax her a little.

22:21.040 --> 22:22.080
As for you,

22:23.080 --> 22:26.240
you're so independent like a wild horse,

22:27.040 --> 22:30.640
making people want to conquer you.

22:30.720 --> 22:31.680
You're shameless.

22:31.760 --> 22:33.120
Ruoyao forgives you

22:33.800 --> 22:34.800
because she likes you.

22:35.680 --> 22:37.280
And you're using her feelings.

22:38.000 --> 22:39.360
Do you really love her?

22:39.440 --> 22:41.520
If she wasn't Jiang Yuanbai's daughter,

22:42.120 --> 22:43.520
would I be engaged to her?

22:45.800 --> 22:47.080
No more questions, right?

22:47.880 --> 22:48.960
Let's begin.

22:50.440 --> 22:51.280
Let go of me!

22:52.200 --> 22:53.040
Get off me!

22:53.120 --> 22:53.960
Zhou Yanbang!

22:55.480 --> 22:57.880
You brought this upon yourself.

23:06.640 --> 23:07.720
I killed him.

23:10.240 --> 23:11.080
I killed him.

23:13.200 --> 23:14.080
I killed him.

23:20.840 --> 23:22.040
I killed him.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.080
Don't panic.

23:33.520 --> 23:34.360
He's not dead.

23:35.160 --> 23:36.000
Jiang Ruoyao,

23:36.480 --> 23:37.560
you love

23:38.360 --> 23:40.600
such a scumbag.

23:43.520 --> 23:44.560
Once you're done crying,

23:45.080 --> 23:46.280
we should hurry up and go home.

23:47.120 --> 23:48.880
This matter might not be easy to handle.

23:48.960 --> 23:51.760
Considering that you promptly knocked out
Zhou Yanbang in time,

23:52.880 --> 23:54.440
I won't hold you accountable

23:54.520 --> 23:55.560
for bringing me here.

23:56.040 --> 23:59.120
You need to figure out
how to explain this to the Zhou family.

24:35.880 --> 24:39.240
JIANG RESIDENCE

24:43.520 --> 24:44.480
Madam Ji.

24:46.040 --> 24:46.880
Madam Ji.

24:46.960 --> 24:47.800
Has Ruoyao returned?

24:50.320 --> 24:51.600
Why isn't she back yet?

24:51.680 --> 24:53.520
Didn't she return with our convoy?

24:53.600 --> 24:55.120
I find it strange too.

24:55.200 --> 24:57.200
And even Jiang Li hasn't returned.

24:57.280 --> 24:58.160
What?

24:58.240 --> 24:59.160
Ms. Sun.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.080
Ms. Sun.

25:05.520 --> 25:06.360
All right.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.280
What happened?

25:07.840 --> 25:09.800
She said Jiang Li
and Ms. Ruoyao returned together.

25:09.880 --> 25:11.000
But they have blood on them.

25:11.080 --> 25:12.040
What?

25:16.320 --> 25:18.000
The daughter of a Chancellor

25:19.280 --> 25:21.960
ridiculously tried to elope with someone.

25:22.040 --> 25:23.560
Don't you care about your reputation?

25:23.640 --> 25:25.280
Don't you even know you were being used?

25:25.360 --> 25:27.640
How did I raise
a foolish daughter like you?

25:30.760 --> 25:32.520
Mother, what should I do?

25:32.600 --> 25:33.440
What should I do now?

25:33.520 --> 25:35.840
Why didn't you think about the outcome
before you did this?

25:35.920 --> 25:38.880
- I'm scared, Mother.
- You brought this upon yourself.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.760
- Mother.
- Don't call me.

25:40.840 --> 25:41.880
Starting today,

25:42.520 --> 25:43.800
stay in this courtyard.

25:44.360 --> 25:45.960
You can't leave without my permission.

25:46.520 --> 25:47.760
Mother.

25:50.560 --> 25:51.520
Madam Ji,

25:51.600 --> 25:53.680
Ms. Ruoyao is scared right now.

25:53.760 --> 25:54.760
She should be comforted.

25:54.840 --> 25:55.840
Comforted?

25:55.920 --> 25:58.040
She should think
about what a foolish thing she's done.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.680
I spoiled her too much in the past,

25:59.760 --> 26:01.160
which led to her being so immature.

26:02.000 --> 26:03.720
Now, let her reflect on her actions.

26:06.320 --> 26:08.880
Go and pass on a message to Jiang Yu'e.

26:08.960 --> 26:10.280
Remember. Don't let anyone see you.

26:10.360 --> 26:11.320
Just say…

26:16.080 --> 26:16.920
Yes, Madam Ji.

26:21.320 --> 26:24.560
My son, Yanbang.

26:26.600 --> 26:28.360
My son.

26:29.280 --> 26:32.120
What am I supposed to do now?

26:33.560 --> 26:34.720
I hurriedly went there

26:35.400 --> 26:37.200
and saw Jiang Li leaving.

26:37.880 --> 26:40.280
My husband was covered in blood

26:40.360 --> 26:41.680
and was unconscious on the ground.

26:42.560 --> 26:45.960
My poor son!

26:46.920 --> 26:47.760
Jiang Li!

26:48.400 --> 26:49.400
- Come out!
- Mrs. Zhou.

26:49.480 --> 26:51.040
- You can't go in. We must inform them.
- Why are you stopping me?

26:51.120 --> 26:52.640
- Don't stop me! Get out of my way!
- Yes, Mrs. Zhou.

26:53.280 --> 26:54.320
- What are you doing?
- Chancellor Jiang.

26:54.840 --> 26:55.800
Chancellor Jiang!

26:55.880 --> 26:58.200
- My son almost died.
- Mrs. Zhou.

26:58.280 --> 26:59.960
It's because of Jiang Li.

27:00.040 --> 27:02.880
She must come out and explain today!

27:02.960 --> 27:04.080
Jiang Li!

27:04.160 --> 27:06.560
- Calm down, Mrs. Zhou.
- Jiang Li, come out here!

27:06.640 --> 27:09.640
Or I won't leave today.

27:09.720 --> 27:11.920
Jiang Li, come out!

27:12.640 --> 27:14.320
Come out!

27:27.320 --> 27:28.280
Have you found Jiuyue?

27:28.360 --> 27:30.280
My lord, you know her.

27:30.360 --> 27:31.680
She usually comes to see us.

27:31.760 --> 27:33.480
When have we ever managed
to track her down?

27:33.560 --> 27:35.240
Why are you so anxious then?

27:35.320 --> 27:37.000
Ms. Jiang Li is in trouble.

27:49.240 --> 27:50.560
Ms. Jiang Li,

27:50.640 --> 27:52.280
his lordship summons you to the main hall.

27:54.760 --> 27:56.840
The Jiang family owes me an explanation.

27:58.320 --> 27:59.600
My son,

27:59.680 --> 28:02.160
a healthy man, was beaten like that.

28:02.840 --> 28:04.600
If I hadn't arrived in time to treat him,

28:05.480 --> 28:06.760
he might have died.

28:07.560 --> 28:09.720
Jiang Li, tell us.

28:10.720 --> 28:12.560
What on earth happened?

28:13.480 --> 28:16.040
Father, after the ritual yesterday,

28:16.760 --> 28:19.000
the carriage driver took me
to a remote area.

28:19.080 --> 28:20.920
By the time I realized it,

28:21.000 --> 28:22.560
he had already disappeared.

28:23.280 --> 28:24.120
Then…

28:25.360 --> 28:27.480
Zhou Yanbang knocked me out, tied me up,

28:27.560 --> 28:29.160
and took me to an abandoned house.

28:29.640 --> 28:32.560
He tried to sexually assault me.

28:33.520 --> 28:36.280
But luckily, Ruoyao arrived
just in time and stopped him.

28:36.840 --> 28:39.040
I sent Ruoyao
to buy some things yesterday.

28:39.120 --> 28:40.520
That's why she returned late.

28:41.280 --> 28:43.240
She never mentioned seeing you.

28:44.040 --> 28:44.880
See?

28:44.960 --> 28:48.160
You lying little wretch!

28:48.240 --> 28:49.320
It must be you

28:49.840 --> 28:51.920
who tried to seduce Yan'er but failed.

28:52.000 --> 28:53.280
And you're afraid he'd tell people,

28:53.360 --> 28:54.880
so you tried to silence him!

28:54.960 --> 28:56.560
If what you said is true,

28:57.440 --> 28:58.680
how would you explain my injuries?

28:58.760 --> 29:00.560
Did I do this to myself?

29:01.560 --> 29:02.760
It's good that you confessed.

29:05.840 --> 29:08.080
Father, Ruoyao was there yesterday.

29:08.560 --> 29:09.960
Why not let Ruoyao come and ask her?

29:13.840 --> 29:15.880
That'd be the best. I'll go and get her.

29:20.840 --> 29:23.240
Remember what I told you.

29:24.040 --> 29:25.560
Just say you don't know anything later.

29:26.120 --> 29:27.560
I've taken care of the rest.

29:28.480 --> 29:30.520
Mother, I don't want to go.

29:30.600 --> 29:32.400
You were asking me what to do yesterday.

29:33.000 --> 29:34.240
Now, you're scared.

29:35.240 --> 29:37.320
Are you letting Jiang Li
blame everything on you?

29:37.800 --> 29:39.720
Do you want to protect yourself or not?

29:40.720 --> 29:41.920
Show some courage.

29:42.000 --> 29:43.840
Don't let Jiang Li outshine you.

29:44.480 --> 29:45.760
Go and wash up.

29:46.760 --> 29:49.480
Mother, you've been scolding me

29:49.560 --> 29:51.440
since yesterday.

29:51.520 --> 29:53.360
Am I really your daughter?

29:53.440 --> 29:54.680
What are you saying?

29:54.760 --> 29:56.160
Who am I doing this for?

30:04.640 --> 30:05.560
Yao'er,

30:06.720 --> 30:07.760
be good and do as I say.

30:08.560 --> 30:10.440
I'm doing this for your own good.

30:11.000 --> 30:12.640
I've already spoken to the Qi family.

30:13.200 --> 30:14.400
Once we take care of Jiang Li,

30:14.880 --> 30:17.560
your marriage will be arranged.

30:18.360 --> 30:20.000
When you're married to the Qi family,

30:20.080 --> 30:21.480
you'll be well taken care of.

30:24.280 --> 30:26.240
Ruoyao, tell me.

30:26.320 --> 30:29.400
Were you there when Yan'er
and Jiang Li were together yesterday?

30:38.880 --> 30:41.080
What did you tell them, Jiang Li?

30:41.760 --> 30:44.840
Yesterday, the carriage driver took me
to a remote place.

30:45.480 --> 30:47.200
Mr. Zhou tried to sexually assault me.

30:48.080 --> 30:50.960
It was you who arrived just in time
and saved me.

30:52.920 --> 30:55.360
Ruoyao, tell us.

30:55.440 --> 30:57.720
What exactly happened yesterday?

31:02.080 --> 31:04.560
Li'er, even if you fear punishment

31:04.640 --> 31:06.480
for hurting Zhou Yanbang,

31:07.280 --> 31:09.320
you shouldn't pin it on your sister.

31:10.280 --> 31:11.720
Even if Zhou Yanbang tried

31:11.800 --> 31:13.760
to assault you as you said,

31:14.480 --> 31:16.240
why was Ruoyao there?

31:17.040 --> 31:18.240
Do you think Yanbang

31:18.320 --> 31:19.880
brought Ruoyao to harm you?

31:20.680 --> 31:21.520
Mother.

31:27.040 --> 31:28.800
Father. Mother.

31:29.880 --> 31:32.080
Ruoyao saw that I hadn't returned
after so long.

31:32.840 --> 31:34.920
She was worried about me,
so she went searching for me.

31:35.520 --> 31:37.560
Later on, she was concerned
I might be in danger

31:37.640 --> 31:39.200
and saved me.

31:39.760 --> 31:41.880
If it wasn't for Ruoyao,

31:42.400 --> 31:43.800
I would've been harmed.

31:45.400 --> 31:47.600
I watched Ruoyao grow up.

31:47.680 --> 31:50.200
She would never hit Yan'er.

31:50.280 --> 31:53.000
It must be you making up lies

31:53.080 --> 31:54.160
to avoid punishment.

31:54.240 --> 31:55.800
Enough. I don't want to hear it anymore.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.800
Mrs. Zhou, please calm down.

31:58.880 --> 32:00.160
Mrs. Jiang,

32:00.680 --> 32:03.440
I came here first
to ask for an explanation

32:03.520 --> 32:05.560
out of respect for our family ties.

32:06.120 --> 32:07.560
Or I would've reported this
to the authorities.

32:08.320 --> 32:09.800
As her parents,

32:09.880 --> 32:12.360
are you letting this girl
argue her way out here?

32:13.320 --> 32:14.160
If that's the case,

32:14.240 --> 32:16.080
let's go to the government office.

32:16.160 --> 32:18.440
Let's all wash our dirty linen in public.

32:19.320 --> 32:20.280
Maybe then

32:20.360 --> 32:22.440
you'll give a proper explanation.

32:27.520 --> 32:29.640
Li'er, I'll ask you one more time.

32:30.280 --> 32:33.360
What exactly happened
between you and Mr. Zhou?

32:33.840 --> 32:36.840
Father, I already told you the truth.

32:36.920 --> 32:39.800
Fine. Keep denying it.

32:40.400 --> 32:42.800
Now, my son can't even move at home

32:42.880 --> 32:44.520
and might not survive.

32:45.080 --> 32:46.040
In that case,

32:46.120 --> 32:48.280
why should I save your reputation?

32:48.360 --> 32:51.120
Guards. Take her to the government office!

32:51.200 --> 32:52.040
- Yes.
- Yes.

32:52.120 --> 32:53.160
Wait.

32:54.600 --> 32:55.720
What else do you have to say?

32:56.600 --> 32:58.240
I don't want a pitiful person's reputation

32:59.000 --> 33:00.360
ruined at the government office.

33:01.320 --> 33:03.000
What nonsense are you spouting?

33:03.080 --> 33:04.760
I've said everything I needed to.

33:04.840 --> 33:06.360
I'm waiting for Ruoyao to speak.

33:12.000 --> 33:15.040
Ruoyao, why are you still silent?

33:18.240 --> 33:19.120
We're sisters.

33:20.720 --> 33:22.080
Regardless of the reason,

33:22.840 --> 33:24.640
you saved my honor yesterday.

33:25.560 --> 33:27.960
I'll never forget this kindness.

33:29.320 --> 33:30.880
You've always been brave.

33:31.440 --> 33:33.840
Even if you were wrong about someone
and trusted him by mistake,

33:33.920 --> 33:34.920
it's not a big deal.

33:36.080 --> 33:38.120
The real mistake is covering for him

33:38.600 --> 33:39.960
and living in fear.

33:43.960 --> 33:46.920
Li'er, stop pressuring your sister.

33:47.000 --> 33:49.280
She really can't lie for your sake.

33:49.360 --> 33:50.720
I'm not pressuring her.

33:52.000 --> 33:53.560
I'm just waiting for her to speak up.

33:54.600 --> 33:55.480
She's old enough.

33:56.320 --> 33:58.320
Must she rely
on her mother for everything?

33:58.880 --> 34:01.360
She needs to discern right
from wrong on her own.

34:01.840 --> 34:03.600
She can't let people
control her life forever.

34:04.240 --> 34:05.640
What are you saying?

34:05.720 --> 34:08.400
Are you trying
to drive a wedge between us?

34:13.199 --> 34:14.920
You've been wronged for so long

34:15.719 --> 34:17.239
and didn't even realize it.

34:18.360 --> 34:21.000
Whenever you face any trouble
since you were little,

34:21.080 --> 34:23.760
you always hide in your room
and wait for people to comfort you.

34:24.400 --> 34:26.840
A few words and you're easily swayed,

34:26.920 --> 34:28.600
willing to be manipulated.

34:28.679 --> 34:30.040
Do you really know what you want?

34:30.560 --> 34:34.000
Having no opinions of your own,
you won't live freely.

34:34.840 --> 34:37.639
Ruoyao, do you understand what I'm saying?

34:41.920 --> 34:44.840
Her mother strictly controlled her
since childhood. She has no opinions.

34:45.360 --> 34:46.920
She'll be devoted to me

34:47.480 --> 34:49.600
if I just coax her a little.

34:55.920 --> 34:58.000
Ruoyao isn't feeling well.

34:58.080 --> 34:59.680
- Ms. Sun.
- Yes.

35:00.160 --> 35:01.480
Take her back to her room to rest.

35:01.560 --> 35:02.440
Yes.

35:04.480 --> 35:05.320
Ms. Ruoyao, come.

35:05.400 --> 35:06.680
Let's go back and rest.

35:07.360 --> 35:08.960
- Let's go. It's all right.
- Jiang Ruoyao.

35:09.840 --> 35:11.600
Are you going to hide in your room again?

35:12.360 --> 35:15.800
Do you want to live like this
for the rest of your life?

35:23.240 --> 35:24.920
How deceptively persuasive.

35:25.000 --> 35:26.920
Guards! Tie her up
and report to the authorities!

35:27.000 --> 35:28.120
- Yes, Mrs. Zhou.
- Let's go.

35:31.320 --> 35:32.160
Father,

35:32.920 --> 35:36.400
what Jiang Li said is true.

35:37.240 --> 35:38.760
I was there yesterday.

35:39.600 --> 35:42.560
I was the one
who accidentally hit Zhou Yanbang.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.320
What nonsense are you talking about?

35:46.400 --> 35:47.840
I'm not talking nonsense.

35:48.880 --> 35:51.640
Jiang Ruoyao,
do you know what you're saying?

35:51.720 --> 35:52.560
I do.

35:52.640 --> 35:54.640
Zhou Yanbang threw his weight around

35:55.600 --> 35:57.600
and tried to sexually assault Jiang Li.

35:58.320 --> 36:00.680
I couldn't bear to see her be defiled,

36:01.200 --> 36:02.680
so in a moment of desperation,

36:02.760 --> 36:05.760
I accidentally hit him too hard.

36:06.480 --> 36:09.360
Everything I say is true
and I'm willing to take responsibility.

36:09.440 --> 36:12.000
Ruoyao, you…

36:14.200 --> 36:15.160
Chancellor Jiang,

36:15.240 --> 36:17.760
you must seek justice for our Yan'er.

36:17.840 --> 36:19.280
Justice?

36:19.840 --> 36:21.560
Shouldn't we also ask
the Marquis of Ningyuan

36:21.640 --> 36:23.840
to seek justice for my daughter, Jiang Li?

36:24.400 --> 36:26.320
Don't you want to report this
to the government office?

36:26.400 --> 36:29.080
Let's go together
and get to the bottom of this.

36:29.960 --> 36:30.960
You…

36:31.040 --> 36:31.920
All of you…

36:33.200 --> 36:34.520
The Jiang family…

36:34.600 --> 36:35.440
You…

36:37.840 --> 36:39.960
- Mrs. Zhou.
- Get a physician.

36:40.040 --> 36:40.880
- Mrs. Zhou.
- Yes.

36:42.080 --> 36:43.880
- Mrs. Zhou.
- Mrs. Zhou.

36:46.240 --> 36:47.080
Mrs. Zhou.

36:47.840 --> 36:50.040
- Mrs. Zhou.
- Go back to your rooms.

36:59.560 --> 37:00.400
Mrs. Zhou.

37:01.640 --> 37:02.520
Mrs. Zhou.

37:04.760 --> 37:05.600
Wait.

37:09.880 --> 37:12.040
Why didn't you reveal

37:12.120 --> 37:14.000
that I was the one
who took you to Zhou Yanbang?

37:14.080 --> 37:15.200
If I revealed it,

37:15.760 --> 37:18.800
I'd force you into saying
you don't know anything.

37:18.880 --> 37:20.280
You still set me up.

37:20.360 --> 37:21.640
Making you speak the truth,

37:22.920 --> 37:24.800
revealing Zhou Yanbang's true colors,

37:25.480 --> 37:27.720
letting you see the situation,
and not be deluded.

37:27.800 --> 37:29.200
Is that setting you up?

37:29.280 --> 37:30.960
Enough with your smooth talk.

37:32.320 --> 37:33.960
You must be very satisfied now, right?

37:35.040 --> 37:36.400
You walk away unscathed

37:37.080 --> 37:39.120
while making Mrs. Zhou hate me even more.

37:40.320 --> 37:41.360
Jiang Li,

37:42.280 --> 37:43.720
since my Hairpin Ceremony,

37:44.320 --> 37:46.600
you've stolen my spotlight,

37:46.680 --> 37:48.920
taken my man,
and snatched everything away from me.

37:49.000 --> 37:51.560
After all this time,
why do you still oppose me?

37:52.320 --> 37:53.480
If you hadn't come back,

37:53.560 --> 37:55.480
I wouldn't be

37:56.680 --> 37:58.600
this miserable, selfish,

37:58.680 --> 38:00.240
cold, and incompetent!

38:00.320 --> 38:01.840
If I hadn't come back,

38:02.840 --> 38:05.040
you wouldn't have turned out
this way and that.

38:05.760 --> 38:08.080
You've said that to me so many times.

38:08.160 --> 38:09.080
Can it do anything?

38:09.640 --> 38:10.680
Is it really because of me

38:11.320 --> 38:12.280
that you've become

38:12.360 --> 38:14.080
someone you don't even like?

38:14.640 --> 38:16.200
If things had gone smoothly for you

38:16.280 --> 38:17.800
and you married Zhou Yanbang,

38:17.880 --> 38:19.440
the despicable person you love,

38:20.120 --> 38:21.720
wouldn't you be scared now?

38:26.640 --> 38:28.040
Are you going to hide again?

38:29.360 --> 38:31.760
You refuse to admit your mistake
and hide when you're scared.

38:32.600 --> 38:34.200
People out there are ruthless

38:34.920 --> 38:36.040
and extremely exploitative.

38:37.240 --> 38:39.160
How long can your little room protect you?

38:39.240 --> 38:40.560
Stop talking already!

38:44.840 --> 38:46.280
I made you tell the truth

38:47.200 --> 38:48.720
to clear my name.

38:48.800 --> 38:51.400
But not every word was insincere.

38:52.360 --> 38:54.680
I told you. You have courage.

38:54.760 --> 38:56.320
When Zhou Yanbang was in trouble,

38:57.000 --> 38:59.440
the Qi family is more powerful
than the Zhou family,

39:00.360 --> 39:02.320
yet you still held on
to your old sweetheart.

39:02.880 --> 39:04.720
It shows you're not heartless.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.760
But that shameless man Zhou Yanbang

39:06.840 --> 39:07.880
is unworthy of you.

39:08.840 --> 39:11.760
Jiang Ruoyao, think carefully

39:12.480 --> 39:14.640
about the kind of person you are.

39:14.720 --> 39:16.600
No one really cares

39:18.000 --> 39:22.160
what Jiang Ruoyao is truly like.

39:36.160 --> 39:39.880
She did everything for her daughter.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.320
But she never considered

39:43.960 --> 39:46.000
that she had almost pushed her
to the brink.

39:46.920 --> 39:47.880
It's truly sad.

39:50.440 --> 39:52.520
Ms. Jiang Li, someone is here to see you.

40:02.720 --> 40:03.800
Where's Jiang Li?

40:04.720 --> 40:05.640
Greetings, Vice Director Ye.

40:05.720 --> 40:07.240
Her ladyship went out
to handle some matters.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.160
Some matters?

40:08.240 --> 40:10.760
I came as soon as I heard about
the incident with Marquis of Ningyuan.

40:11.320 --> 40:12.880
Did Mrs. Zhou take her away?

40:12.960 --> 40:15.120
The matter has already
been resolved today.

40:15.200 --> 40:16.800
There's no more problem with Mrs. Zhou.

40:16.880 --> 40:19.000
So why did Jiang Li go out?

40:24.040 --> 40:25.160
You don't need to tell me.

40:26.520 --> 40:27.360
I think I know.

40:48.440 --> 40:50.800
I remember the last time
you treated me to a meal

40:50.880 --> 40:52.760
was in Luyang for some steamed buns.

40:53.520 --> 40:54.840
This time, you're really generous.

40:55.920 --> 40:57.360
That day, you defeated Tong Zhiyang,

40:57.840 --> 40:59.120
but you weren't happy.

41:00.880 --> 41:01.760
What about this time?

41:04.320 --> 41:05.200
Can we have a drink?

41:05.280 --> 41:06.880
Do you think I won this time?

41:07.360 --> 41:08.720
Winning or losing isn't important.

41:10.120 --> 41:12.240
But you can't skip a meal.

41:15.640 --> 41:16.960
Do you know

41:17.680 --> 41:19.280
every move I make?

41:19.360 --> 41:20.440
A chess player

41:21.360 --> 41:23.640
always knows where his pieces are.

41:28.720 --> 41:30.680
Do we have a chance to switch roles?

41:33.320 --> 41:34.520
I'd like to play chess too.

41:35.240 --> 41:36.680
I want to compete

41:36.760 --> 41:39.240
with those people
in the capital of Great Yan.

41:39.320 --> 41:40.320
Using which pieces?

41:42.120 --> 41:42.960
Me?

41:45.360 --> 41:46.960
You dare to say that,

41:47.760 --> 41:48.600
but I dare not.

41:49.320 --> 41:50.680
But I do wonder

41:50.760 --> 41:52.560
if a woman like me

41:52.640 --> 41:54.760
could ever see a bigger world.

41:57.880 --> 41:58.880
Enough talk.

41:59.440 --> 42:00.760
I should thank you

42:00.840 --> 42:02.240
for today's feast.

42:02.800 --> 42:03.760
I am happy today.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.360
But I must say,

42:05.440 --> 42:06.680
I can't drink much.

42:06.760 --> 42:07.600
Just this one cup.

42:07.680 --> 42:09.680
If I offend you,

42:09.760 --> 42:11.440
please don't send me away.

42:11.520 --> 42:12.360
I won't go that far.

42:13.760 --> 42:14.960
By the way,

42:15.040 --> 42:16.760
Situ Jiuyue is not in the capital.

42:16.840 --> 42:19.000
It might take some time to find her.

42:19.080 --> 42:21.640
I thank you on behalf of Magistrate Xue.

42:39.640 --> 42:41.000
Are you already drunk with one cup?

42:41.560 --> 42:42.440
No.

42:43.360 --> 42:44.720
I'm just sleepy after the commotion

42:45.360 --> 42:46.240
this morning.

42:47.360 --> 42:48.680
I'd like to take a nap.

42:48.760 --> 42:49.680
Then sleep.

44:05.200 --> 44:07.080
It's uncomfortable
to sleep everywhere else.

44:08.480 --> 44:10.320
But the place you picked

44:11.920 --> 44:12.840
sure isn't bad.

44:14.360 --> 44:15.200
I'm glad you like it.

44:24.000 --> 44:25.200
I have something for you.

44:25.760 --> 44:26.680
What is it?

44:29.400 --> 44:31.560
If you need help, blow this whistle.

44:31.640 --> 44:33.920
My men will come to protect you for me.

44:36.880 --> 44:37.840
Does that mean

44:38.360 --> 44:39.440
you will always

44:39.520 --> 44:41.280
have someone watching me?

44:41.840 --> 44:42.840
You could see it that way.

44:44.320 --> 44:45.160
Take it.

44:49.280 --> 44:51.520
I just don't want my chess game
to end prematurely

44:54.440 --> 44:55.400
because someone

44:57.120 --> 44:58.160
took my pawn.
